&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;As Principal System Architect for Reusability, you will&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;lead&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;exploration of the reusable-launcher design space and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;drive convergence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;towards a coherent vehicle architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot;&gt;Using models and analyses developed by specialist teams, you will identify the most valuable design paths, direct further investigation and make architecture decisions that balance performance, development risk, operability, lifecycle cost and profitability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW176097795 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end architecture of the reusable launch vehicle, including its configuration, interfaces, operational concept and key dependencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define the architecture exploration strategy: structure the design space, select promising paths and determine where further analysis or testing is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead multidisciplinary trades using inputs and model outputs from specialist teams; challenge assumptions, expose dependencies and resolve conflicting objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive architecture decisions and convergence, maintaining clear rationale, configuration baselines and priorities for the next exploration cycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Balance vehicle performance and recovery with production, supply chain, logistics, launch operations, refurbishment, cadence, lifecycle cost, market demand and profitability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Align engineering, operations, program, finance and commercial stakeholders around the selected architecture and communicate decisions, risks and remaining trades clearly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
